WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:08.233
ATINGERE — A book becomes braille on the touchscreen, with vibrations, for deaf-blind people, or an audiobook for blind people.

2
00:00:08.433 --> 00:00:16.567
Clopoțel — Keep your conference or workshop on time: a stage timer with your agenda and a signal that warns when the end is near.

3
00:00:16.767 --> 00:00:24.900
MONSTRARIUM — Plan a workshop making monsters from recycled materials: the app works out materials and sessions and offers 50 monsters with sounds, 3D and an educational game.

4
00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:33.233
ETER — Learn amateur radio in an encyclopedia with Morse code, a Morse trainer, antenna calculators and search across all the content.

5
00:00:33.433 --> 00:00:41.567
Fabrica — Write a course as plain text and turn it into a page with lessons, a final test and a printable certificate.

6
00:00:41.767 --> 00:00:49.900
FASCICUL — Turns the phones in the room into a shared board on a video projector: drawings, notes, images, laser pointer and live camera.

7
00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:58.233
INDICATIV — Prepare for the ANCOM amateur radio exam with 723 questions, repeated at suitable intervals, without an internet connection.

8
00:00:58.433 --> 00:01:06.567
PULS — What do you do until the ambulance arrives?

9
00:01:06.767 --> 00:01:14.900
QSO — Keep track of the radio contacts from your amateur radio station, with UTC time, locators and statistics.

10
00:01:15.100 --> 00:01:23.233
RegexLab — Try a regular expression and see right away what it matches, with step-by-step explanations, tests and a warning when it could freeze the program.

11
00:01:23.433 --> 00:01:31.567
SEOptimum — Check how well a web page is prepared for search engines.

12
00:01:31.767 --> 00:01:39.900
SEVA — Learn more about sleep, the body's daily rhythm, breathing and nutrition, in an encyclopedia you can also listen to.
